- ORCH CEO #3 (two-panel `/`) + #4 (iMessage pastel bubbles + dual timestamps). BE has no required code — confirmed `created_at` is the **real UTC send time, exposed** as `meta.created_at` (no flag), and told FE to derive relative+12hr client-side.
